湄公河流域文化系统与红河—北部湾文化系统之间的历史交通和文化交流节点。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q465947","articleTitle":"川圹省","sourceRevision":92704965,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 川圹省","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%9D%E5%9C%B9%E7%9C%81"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92704965"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q465947"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"LA-XE","name":"塞公省","english":"Xékong","country":"LAO","lat":15.6414,"lon":106.982,"kind":"region","bbox":[106.3001,15.044,107.6576,16.1848],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[107.136,16.1848],[107.299,16.0642],[107.4356,16.0688],[107.4447,16.01],[107.3755,15.9191],[107.2357,15.8555],[107.1863,15.8594],[107.1488,15.7735],[107.2257,15.7168],[107.2391,15.6451],[107.3164,15.5887],[107.3693,15.4961],[107.443,15.5092],[107.4875,15.4814],[107.4939,15.42],[107.5732,15.4112],[107.5866,15.3434],[107.6576,15.2824],[107.6568,15.2057],[107.6273,15.1965],[107.578,15.0472],[107.5024,15.044],[107.5196,15.0848],[107.4607,15.1815],[107.3467,15.1655],[107.1686,15.2763],[106.9451,15.2291],[106.7907,15.2547],[106.6717,15.1375],[106.6662,15.2223],[106.562,15.3026],[106.4709,15.3251],[106.4246,15.3815],[106.3165,15.4201],[106.3001,15.4678],[106.3512,15.513],[106.4306,15.4918],[106.4622,15.5307],[106.6791,15.5452],[106.6981,15.6239],[106.6734,15.6824],[106.6994,15.7159],[106.652,15.776],[106.8044,15.962],[106.8176,16.0493],[106.9843,16.0388],[107.0691,16.0776],[107.136,16.1848]]]},"knowledge":{"theme":"塞公省 · 地点概要","geo":"塞公省，一译公河省，是老挝南部的一个省，东邻越南。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q585707","articleTitle":"塞公省","sourceRevision":89940775,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, c