寺，以及寺内的一座佛塔。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q9326","articleTitle":"永珍","sourceRevision":93804063,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 永珍","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E7%8F%8D"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93804063"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q9326"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159146821","name":"凯山丰威汉","country":"LAO","lat":16.53758,"lon":104.77297,"kind":"city","region":"LA-SV","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159139135","name":"沙耶武里","country":"LAO","lat":19.25046,"lon":101.75006,"kind":"city","region":"LA-XA","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159139139","name":"巴色","country":"LAO","lat":15.12206,"lon":105.81834,"kind":"city","region":"LA-CH","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"巴色 · 地点概要","geo":"巴色因位于色东河汇流至湄公河河口而得名，“巴”寮文意思为口，即河口之意，而“色”为色东河简称。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q383622","articleTitle":"巴色","sourceRevision":93200998,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 巴色","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E8%89%B2"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93200998"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q383622"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159139143","name":"丰沙湾","country":"LAO","lat":19.4519,"lon":103.196,"kind":"city","region":"LA-XI","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159139147","name":"琅勃拉邦","country":"LAO","lat":19.88453,"lon":102.14161,"kind":"city","region":"LA-LP","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"琅勃拉邦 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"琅勃拉邦，又译隆勃拉邦、銮巴拉邦，寮国华人称龙坡邦、銮佛邦，是老挝上寮重镇，琅勃拉邦省省会。\n琅勃拉邦已有千余年的历史，被认定为世界遗产。","culture":"1353年，法昂统一老挝，建立澜沧王国，定都于此，改名川铜（意为“金城”）。\n1777年，吞武里王朝入侵永珍，成为暹逻的属领，掠夺勃拉邦佛和玉佛带回曼谷。","see":"市内名胜古迹有帕维逊摩诃维汉寺、玛莫塔、金塔山和王宫等。\n关西瀑布（，英语，Kuang Si Falls）。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q190165","articleTitle":"琅勃拉邦","sourceRevision":93513190,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 琅勃拉邦","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%90%85%E5%8B%83%E6%8B%89%E9%82%A6"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93513190"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q190165"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159139153","name":"他曲","country":"LAO","lat":17.4112,"lon":104.83612,"kind":"city","region":"LA-KH","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"他曲 · 地点概要","geo":"他曲，又名“塔克”，意为印度商人的码头，老挝中南部城市。\n甘蒙省首府，为一边境口岸城市，对岸是泰国湄公河畔城市那空拍侬。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1018701","articleTitle":"他曲","sourceRevision":93973600,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 他曲","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%96%E6%9B%B2"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93973600"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1018701"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159119305","name":"会晒","country":"LAO","lat":20.2775,"lon":100.41278,"kind":"city","region":"LA-BK","rank":10,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"会晒 · 地点概要","geo":"位于该国西北部的湄公河左岸，与泰国清孔县隔河相望。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q717371","articleTitle":"會晒","sourceRevision":93201011,"method":"Full-a